<view class="container theme-{{themeKey}}"><view class="header">我的食谱</view><view class="card"><view class="title">每日推荐</view><view class="plan-item" wx:for="{{plan}}" wx:key="id"><text class="pn">{{item.name}}</text><text class="pi">{{item.kcal}} kcal · 蛋白质 {{item.protein}}g</text></view><view class="placeholder" wx:if="{{!plan.length}}">暂无每日推荐，去食谱挑选吧</view></view><view class="card"><view class="title">自定义食谱</view><view class="fav-item" wx:for="{{custom}}" wx:key="id" bindtap="goDetail" data-id="{{item.id}}"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text class="pi">{{item.kcal}} kcal · 蛋白质 {{item.protein}}g</text></view><view class="placeholder" wx:if="{{!custom.length}}">暂无自定义食谱，可在食谱页添加</view></view><view class="card"><view class="title">我的收藏</view><view class="fav-item" wx:for="{{favorites}}" wx:key="id" bindtap="goDetail" data-id="{{item.id}}"><text>{{item.name}}</text></view><view class="placeholder" wx:if="{{!favorites.length}}">暂无收藏</view></view></view>